@host = http://localhost:5002

# Seeded ids (see Infrastructure/Persistence/SeedData.cs)
@openCart = c1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@paidOrder = d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@pendingOrder = d1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

### Seeded open cart (keyboard + 2 mice)
GET {{host}}/carts/{{openCart}}

### Add an item to it (Desk Lamp from the Marketplace seed)
POST {{host}}/carts/{{openCart}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": "b1000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006", "productName": "Desk Lamp", "unitPrice": 89.90, "quantity": 1 }

### Check it out -> creates a new pending order
POST {{host}}/carts/{{openCart}}/checkout

### Seeded paid order
GET {{host}}/orders/{{paidOrder}}

### Pay the seeded pending order
POST {{host}}/orders/{{pendingOrder}}/pay

### Paying it again fails with 400
POST {{host}}/orders/{{pendingOrder}}/pay

### Start a fresh cart
POST {{host}}/carts
